  "title": "The Local Crime Bosses of Tatooine",
  "description": "In Boba Fett's palace, he hosts the leaders of all the local gangs and syndicates. The Aqualish, the Klatooinians and the Trandoshans all sit at the table. When the groups show insolence and offer threats, the rancor below informs them of their folly. Fett proposes that all of the families unite against the Pykes. They all decline to take action, but Boba is at the very least able to convince them to remain neutral in the war against the Pyke Syndicate."
